{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50859","headline":"省题诗二十一首 农祥晨正 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 农祥晨正","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉律方移候，农祥已向晨。\n昭回当午地，皎洁向天津。\n北陆收残冻，东臯见早春。\n影浮佳气动，光射曙云新。\n千亩功将起，三推礼欲申。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}